    "b-30-runtime-dry-run-mode-writes-the-8": {
      "id": "b-30-runtime-dry-run-mode-writes-the-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Dry-run mode writes the full rendered prompts and a synthetic Pi output\nartifact without calling the Pi SDK. DB-backed live mode uses kernel\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "createSpawnAgent",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " through the server-local kernel bridge: converted catalog\nagents read each role's typed "
        },
        {
          "insert": "agent.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " definition, provide the rendered\nPromptKit system prompt as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "ParsedAgent.body",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", pass a short first-turn prompt,\nand attach an optional "
        },
        {
          "insert": "AgentContextResolver",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " built from\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "PiPromptBundle.kernelContext",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-30-runtime-when-a-resolver-is-prese-9": {
      "id": "b-30-runtime-when-a-resolver-is-prese-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "When a resolver is present, the server bridge passes it to the kernel spawn\npipeline. The kernel resolves the declared context inputs, emits context\nlifecycle trace events, injects the assembled context into the Pi session, and\nthen triggers the short turn prompt. Prompt artifacts still persist the full\nrendered context packet so dry-run, audit, and dashboard previews show the\ncomplete injected input."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
